{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The bundle includes two new tanks: Red Pepper and Colorful.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each tank comes with unique advantages in battle, such as faster turret rotation and increased overall speed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You'll also get an exclusive set of decorations for the \u201cMasquerade\u201d and \u201cDead Winter\u201d levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Red Pepper</strong>\u00a0- is the most powerful tank, leaving fiery trails in its wake. It was designed to ensure nothing stands in your way. No other tank can surpass it in speed. And opponents will only see the fire behind you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1826740/extras/308cbfaecd2d75fdaf014347815ef52c.poster.avif?t=1754469882\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1826740/extras/308cbfaecd2d75fdaf014347815ef52c.webm?t=1754469882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1826740/extras/308cbfaecd2d75fdaf014347815ef52c.mp4?t=1754469882\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1826740/extras/bdf824f62fe2091decfa1f51dc8643e7.avif?t=1754469882\" data-has-big /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1826740?t=1754469882","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1826740/fd402a5a9f6263540a546f67cfb984cee5566636/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1754469882","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1826740/3af4bf6bd8bea20ee6a3dbfe8e3b7186be474ed4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754469882","capsule_imagev5":"http